{"seq":2,"slug":"model-merging","title":"模型合并技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/evaluation-and-deployment/model-merging","wordCount":861,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"模型合并技术\">模型合并技术</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>模型合并（Model Merging）是将多个微调模型的能力组合到单个模型中的技术。不同于集成推理（需要运行多个模型），模型合并在权重空间中操作，生成一个拥有多模型能力的单一模型，推理成本与单模型相同。这项技术在 LLM 社区迅速流行，成为提升模型综合能力的重要手段。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[基础模型] --&gt; B[微调模型 A 代码能力]&#10;    A --&gt; C[微调模型 B 数学推理]&#10;    A --&gt; D[微调模型 C 对话能力]&#10;    B --&gt; E[模型合并]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[综合能力模型]\">graph TB\n    A[基础模型] --&gt; B[微调模型 A 代码能力]\n    A --&gt; C[微调模型 B 数学推理]\n    A --&gt; D[微调模型 C 对话能力]\n    B --&gt; E[模型合并]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[综合能力模型]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>合并方法</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>需要训练数据</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Linear (LERP)</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>基础</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>两模型简单平均</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SLERP</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>较好</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>两模型球面插值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TIES</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>多模型稀疏合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DARE</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>随机丢弃后合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Task Arithmetic</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>任务向量运算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Model Stock</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>最好</td>\n<td>少量</td>\n<td>权重空间优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"线性插值与-slerp\">线性插值与 SLERP</h2><p>最简单的合并方法是线性插值（Linear Interpolation），将两个模型的权重按比例混合。SLERP（Spherical Linear Interpolation）在球面空间中插值，保持权重向量的范数，通常比线性插值效果更好：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;from transformers import AutoModelForCausalLM&#10;&#10;def linear_merge(model_a_path: str, model_b_path: str, alpha: float = 0.5) -&gt; dict:&#10;    model_a = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(model_a_path)&#10;    model_b = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(model_b_path)&#10;&#10;    merged_state = {}&#10;    for key in model_a.state_dict():&#10;        merged_state[key] = (1 - alpha) * model_a.state_dict()[key] + alpha * model_b.state_dict()[key]&#10;&#10;    return merged_state&#10;&#10;&#10;def slerp_merge(&#10;    model_a_path: str,&#10;    model_b_path: str,&#10;    t: float = 0.5,&#10;) -&gt; dict:&#10;    model_a = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(model_a_path)&#10;    model_b = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(model_b_path)&#10;&#10;    merged_state = {}&#10;    for key in model_a.state_dict():&#10;        w_a = model_a.state_dict()[key].float()&#10;        w_b = model_b.state_dict()[key].float()&#10;&#10;        if w_a.dim() &gt;= 2:&#10;            dot = torch.sum(w_a * w_b) / (torch.norm(w_a) * torch.norm(w_b))&#10;            omega = torch.acos(torch.clamp(dot, -1, 1))&#10;            if omega.abs() &lt; 1e-10:&#10;                merged_state[key] = (1 - t) * w_a + t * w_b&#10;            else:&#10;                merged_state[key] = (&#10;                    torch.sin((1 - t) * omega) / torch.sin(omega) * w_a&#10;                    + torch.sin(t * omega) / torch.sin(omega) * w_b&#10;                )&#10;        else:&#10;            merged_state[key] = (1 - t) * w_a + t * w_b&#10;&#10;    return merged_state\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> linear_merge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(model_a_path: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, model_b_path: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, alpha: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model_a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(model_a_path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model_b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(model_b_path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    merged_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model_a.state_dict():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        merged_state[key] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model_a.state_dict()[key] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model_b.state_dict()[key]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merged_state</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> slerp_merge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model_a_path: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model_b_path: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    t: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark: